<title>INDIA: India's Punjab Tractors 96/97 net rises.</title>
<headline>India's Punjab Tractors 96/97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Punjab Tractors Ltd posted a net profit of 563.1 million rupees in 1996/97 (April-March) compared with 382.2 million rupees in the previous year, the Press Trust of India (PTI) reported on Friday.  </p>
<p>The newsagency said the company has announced an 80 percent dividend for 1996/97.</p>
<p>The company's sales turnover increased to 6.06 billion rupees in 1996/97 against 4.55 billion in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
